<title>UK: Littlewoods H1 reports profit of 12.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Littlewoods H1 reports profit of 12.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.5		   vs 16.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   995		    vs 1,048</p>
<p>NOTE - Privately-owned retail and leisure group Littlewoods Organisation said pretax profits in the first half last year included exceptional property profits of 10.2 million.</p>
<p>Retail sales rose seven percent to 748 million stg from 698 million in the six months.  </p>
<p>The group said sales growth in the second half had exceeded first half levels and &quot;provided these trends can continue, operating profits for the 12 months to December 1996 are expected to be significantly ahead of last year,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
